subsection.subsection:
Deeds issued by the county auditor under this section shall recite the following:
the total amount of all the delinquent taxes, tax notice charges, penalties, interest, and administrative costs which were paid in for the execution and delivery of the deed;
the year for which the property was assessed or a tax notice charge was listed, the year the property became delinquent, and the year the property was subject to tax sale;
a full description of the property; and
the name of the grantee.
